# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of which OS checks
# the file out or commits it -- this repo is worked on across both Windows and
# Linux. `text=auto` lets Git decide text-vs-binary per file; the explicit `eol=lf`
# rules below force LF on checkout for the source/text types actually in this repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.webm binary
*.wmv binary
*.xls binary
*.doc binary
*.exe binary
